{
  "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
  "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "voice_key": "yunxi",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.92,
      "size": 46800,
      "text": "看哈尔沃森系统的三个方程，你会立刻发现它们的形状完全相同，只是变量在轮换。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.44,
      "size": 55008,
      "text": "第一个方程里 x 的位置，在第二个方程里换成了 y，在第三个方程里换成了 z。这叫循环对称。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.61,
      "size": 41760,
      "text": "这种对称不只是写起来好看。它会在吸引子的形状上留下明确的印记。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "symmetry",
      "line_id": "sm-1",
      "filename": "symmetry-sm-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/symmetry-sm-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.75,
      "size": 60048,
      "text": "严格地说，把坐标做循环替换，也就是 x 变 y、y 变 z、z 变 x，方程组变回它自己。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "symmetry",
      "line_id": "sm-2",
      "filename": "symmetry-sm-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/symmetry-sm-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.12,
      "size": 65952,
      "text": "用向量场的语言：对位置做循环移位再求导，等于先求导再对结果做循环移位。这两条路径给出完全相同的向量。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "symmetry",
      "line_id": "sm-3",
      "filename": "symmetry-sm-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/symmetry-sm-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.58,
      "size": 41328,
      "text": "屏幕上验证的偏差是精确的零。这不是近似成立，而是恒等式。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "threefold",
      "line_id": "tf-1",
      "filename": "threefold-tf-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/threefold-tf-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.64,
      "size": 42192,
      "text": "循环移位在几何上对应什么？答案是绕对角线方向转一百二十度。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "threefold",
      "line_id": "tf-2",
      "filename": "threefold-tf-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/threefold-tf-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.74,
      "size": 59904,
      "text": "所以吸引子必然具有三重旋转对称：绕着从原点指向一一一方向的那条轴转一百二十度，形状完全复原。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "threefold",
      "line_id": "tf-3",
      "filename": "threefold-tf-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/threefold-tf-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.42,
      "size": 54720,
      "text": "旋转视角观察，你能数出三片彼此缠绕的叶瓣。这是方程对称性的直接产物，不是巧合。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "dissipation",
      "line_id": "ds-1",
      "filename": "dissipation-ds-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/dissipation-ds-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.85,
      "size": 45648,
      "text": "算它的散度会得到一个漂亮结果：恒等于负三倍的参数 a，与位置完全无关。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "dissipation",
      "line_id": "ds-2",
      "filename": "dissipation-ds-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/dissipation-ds-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.45,
      "size": 55152,
      "text": "三个方程各有一个线性阻尼项，各自贡献负 a，加起来就是负三 a。整个相空间以同一速率收缩。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "dissipation",
      "line_id": "ds-3",
      "filename": "dissipation-ds-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/dissipation-ds-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.14,
      "size": 66240,
      "text": "这和蔡氏系统形成对比：那里散度分段变号，这里处处相同。均匀耗散却依然混沌，说明混沌的来源在非线性项。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "equilibria",
      "line_id": "eq-1",
      "filename": "equilibria-eq-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/equilibria-eq-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.46,
      "size": 55296,
      "text": "对称性还能帮我们找平衡点。既然系统在循环移位下不变，那么对角线上的点值得优先检查。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "equilibria",
      "line_id": "eq-2",
      "filename": "equilibria-eq-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/equilibria-eq-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.24,
      "size": 51840,
      "text": "在 x 等于 y 等于 z 时，三个方程退化为同一个二次方程，解出两个根：原点和负的 a 加八。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "equilibria",
      "line_id": "eq-3",
      "filename": "equilibria-eq-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/equilibria-eq-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.58,
      "size": 57312,
      "text": "请拖动参数观察。a 变大时耗散加强，吸引子收得更紧，但三重对称始终保持不变。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.49,
      "size": 39888,
      "text": "第一，哈尔沃森系统的三个方程在循环替换下不变，这是严格的恒等式。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.75,
      "size": 44064,
      "text": "第二，循环对称对应绕对角线转一百二十度，故吸引子有三重旋转对称。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "halvorsen-attractor",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/halvorsen-attractor/yunxi/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.57,
      "size": 57168,
      "text": "第三，散度恒为负三 a，耗散均匀，混沌来自二次非线性项。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
